  "id": "section-869",
  "title": "关于夺权问题",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-249.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>249)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　如果权落在右派手里，权本来就在右派手里，夺过来。如果再被别人夺过去。仍然在右派手，没有什么了不起，还可以再夺。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-248.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-250.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
